{
  "_about": "The tutorial's missions, in the order data/kc_graph.json teaches (Sam, 2026-10-04: a dedicated tutorial mode that is a map of missions following the teaching flow; analysis/kc/RESULTS.md). A mission teaches the components in teaches, shows the edges in builds_on (their sentences tie it to what the player already has), and makes them concrete in its tasks: a drill in the yard, or a fight on the road. A mission with two tasks is a comparison: two fights that differ in one thing, which kc_compare.<id> names, after Gick and Holyoak by way of the proposal (abstraction comes from comparison). c_swing_plant is the one new item: the graph found no item that asks for a swing and a plant together. crates/content/tests/tutorial.rs checks that every component is taught, after each component it builds on, and that each task's drill or fight requires what the mission teaches. m_throw, m_ledge and m_flank (2026-10-06) teach throwing, standing on a ledge and fighting two at once. The yard goals' numbers were set (2026-10-06) so that loose timing meets them: every_yard_goal_is_met_with_loose_timing.",
